    source('src-chappie-synopsis', 'Chappie', 'Rotten Tomatoes film synopsis', 'https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/chappie', 'secondary_film_synopsis_indexed', 'Public mechanized-policing synopsis read', 'A mechanized police force and the emergence of a thinking robot.', 'A policing sector is not a complete material economy or a human participation census.'),
    source('src-bigbug-netflix-synopsis', 'Bigbug', 'Netflix Media Center', 'https://media.netflix.com/en/only-on-netflix/81158472', 'official_film_synopsis', 'Public synopsis lines 7-12 read', 'Human dependence on AI for needs and desires precedes domestic confinement and the Yonyx takeover attempt.', 'Promotional generalization, not a detailed account of prices, universal welfare or asset ownership.'),
    source('src-bigbug-netflix-characters', 'All the Robots and Humans Trapped Together in Jean-Pierre Jeunet’s Bigbug', 'Samantha Nelson / Netflix Tudum', 'https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/cast-bigbug-jean-pierre-jeunet-french-actors', 'official_film_character_guide', 'Opening work-delegation and household passages read; indexed control-code passage read', 'Most work is delegated to robots; Alice’s household has artistic activity and unequal access to robot control codes.', 'No numeric labor census. Domestic command can fail during protective confinement, and later Yonyx authority is a different period.'),
